            <div class="c-mega-menu__section-grid">
              <div class="c-mega-menu__details">
                <div class="c-mega-menu__description">DEC protects the land, water, and air resources in New York. Whether it is addressing climate change effects, promoting responsible waste management, monitoring air quality, overseeing contaminated site clean-ups, or oil and gas mining monitoring, DEC is there to safeguard the environment; you can too by reporting environmental violations and problems. </div>
